     <widget class="QCheckBox" name="guiScanAttachmentsCheckbox">
      <property name="toolTip">
       <string>Before an attachment opens in another application, its content is sent to the ClamAV daemon (clamd) on this computer. Nothing leaves the computer. A threat blocks opening; when clamd cannot be reached or cannot decide, you are asked first. The socket is found automatically, or set with ClamdSocket in the MailSafety group of plasma-impresariorc.</string>
      </property>
      <property name="text">
